<p>Hiii! Long time no see! I am<span style="color: #e0f799;">&nbsp;</span><span style="color: rgb(224, 247, 153);">Verde</span> the green fox, I am back! 🦊💚</p>

<p><span style="color: #e0f799;"><strong>Verde</strong></span> is a<strong>&nbsp;Cartoon-style fox</strong> living in Voxel World, with a tall and slender body and a red <strong>bandana&nbsp;</strong>he always wears. &nbsp;(I&rsquo;m proud of it!)</p>

<p>He was<strong>&nbsp;the first Cartoon character</strong> invited to live in <strong>Voxel World</strong>. After seeing the city&rsquo;s potential, Verde decided to settle down and become part of its growing community. He had so much fun exploring Voxel World that he began introducing it to others, encouraging more and more Cartoon characters to visit. (You should come and see it too!)</p>

<p>Verde is<strong>&nbsp;kind, cheerful, and a little silly</strong>. He enjoys discovering new places, <strong>traveling around&nbsp;</strong>Voxel World, and spending time in nature. He especially loves <strong>fishing</strong> with his friend <span style="color: #ed782d;">Wisky</span>, and sharing jokes around his friends. And take a bite of blocky donuts would be the best thing for him!</p>

<p>Although Verde is usually positive and friendly, he<strong>&nbsp;can become angry</strong> when things go badly. He also dislikes <strong>loud noises&nbsp;</strong>and cannot stand being mocked or <strong>humiliated</strong>. Verde cares deeply about his friends, so losing someone close to him can be especially painful.</p>

<p>As one of the<strong>&nbsp;earliest Cartoon residents</strong> and a witness to Voxel World&rsquo;s growth, Verde hopes to keep exploring with his friends and <strong>help the world become an even brighter place</strong>!</p>
